NEWSPAPER_AD_CANDO = nPee || nScat

@NEWSPAPER_53
RESETCOLOR
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
FONTBOLD
PRINTFORML 효과적인 배변 수준
PRINTFORML 배변 훈련됨 (EPL > 0)
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML ───────────────────────────────
